<title>Colombia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/colombia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-colombia-2026-11-13T01:59:48.441Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:59:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Colombian army has intensified air strikes against Gulf Clan leaders, killing senior figures and multiple members, while cocaine-linked militias are deploying Ukraine-style drones against security forces, including a drone attack that killed four soldiers. Venezuela and Colombia have begun joint border security cooperation after recent kidnappings, and the United States has deployed drones to target the ELN, the deadliest guerrilla group. Recruitment into minor armed groups has surged as terrorism cases quadruple under President De la Espriella, and threats against journalists have risen following a grenade blast outside a TV network. ICE agents with histories of racism have been implicated in the killing of a Colombian migrant. The conflict remains low-intensity with 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPcjFQM3Z1RUNQdmtuXzRvWWJWZ3NldjRJdkFQSVctQXBRSm5OR2VwTGF3aHZDRjlDU0RvUzY4d0RURk80bzZTZUpRcl9ob2I4UGVfaFRaTjZ6YUVHcUFfaU5fOV9GbWNqRHllN2NfdDJxTmoydXVlZ0JsbUdjbHN6cldJOEh0YjY5Q0VLT0NoTHNBb0FlRklnNDAwNHd6amVLYnBYanlkZ3FobjNZdkluekJoQWhadEhGNlZr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1MZGNnQ3BCTkhTdjUtTWxTWXh6Z3A3ekZSZ19jX1MzSWhVcVEtNmpWV3J3bThLNXhrNGJoa1hTQXBJYmVfWHRpQmtBbjdKTmhTN3VHM0NKUjJnSVpnSHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPTUZsRWhYbFRFNUY1SFYya3hLb2w3bHRjck5UVmRoMGprQU9JR3BCMjVyWW55N2VyUzJ6M1hOLUVaMll5S0FQTmJqcHZZSm5sNXdNVk1yYWo5Tm5QY1hKUzNuSzJvcjk5UlJmNWduRjI2cXdaUE1VSVRtdU5ldFJ5ZVU0aEJzM2JDRXUwdlJ5X0h4S1NTZzJ1eGxUMW5qSTFzY3FYT0t2S0tlM05zVUNFTzI1cnA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQc3Vmd3FsUjZLaTcwQlpjNDlteWdTT0